  <text>
    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="20.8">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IIAs">II As</ref> 20.8</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ætwinde, ⁊ hine hwa feormige, sy he his weres scyldig, buton he hine ladian durre be þæs flyman were, þæt he hine flyman nyste.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">If he escapes and anyone harbours him, he [who does so] shall forfeit his wergeld unless he dares to clear himself by [declaring an oath equal to] the fugitive's wergeld, that he did not know he was a fugitive.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">Gif he ðonne oþwinde, ⁊ hwa hine feormige, sy his weres scyldig, butan he hine ladian durre be ðæs flyman were, þæt he hine flymene nyste.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
